WEBVTT

00:02.469 --> 00:03.936
Legend has it that...

00:05.105 --> 00:07.903
...during the Heian Period, there were
men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.241 --> 00:13.577
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.048 --> 00:20.213
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.333 --> 00:40.762
<i>The Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.041 --> 00:46.877
<i>Rushing through my innocent</i>
<i>youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.415 --> 00:54.320
<i>This soul of mine is</i>
<i>so easy to influence.</i>

00:55.989 --> 00:59.755
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

00:59.860 --> 01:03.057
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:06.833 --> 01:13.898
<i>This is what I'm wishing</i>
<i>for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.074 --> 01:19.910
<i>I want you to acknowledge</i>
<i>me, that's all.</i>

01:20.780 --> 01:28.050
<i>You smiled at me for</i>
<i>the very first time.</i>

01:28.221 --> 01:36.629
<i>Thank you so much, thank you</i>
<i>from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.330 --> 01:38.991
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:48.742 --> 01:52.178
<i>Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

01:53.380 --> 02:00.718
<i>My Friend, Ryoma Sakamoto</i>

02:03.790 --> 02:07.021
<i>Oomiya</i>

02:10.063 --> 02:13.157
Izumi should've been back by now.

02:13.266 --> 02:14.961
I wonder if something happened to
him?

02:15.502 --> 02:16.969
You have a point.

02:17.070 --> 02:18.332
It's not like him.

02:18.505 --> 02:22.373
To leave your side for such a long
time...

02:25.178 --> 02:27.840
Where are you going?
Hanjiro the Assassin?

02:30.951 --> 02:33.317
Izumi Mutsu, eh?

02:34.087 --> 02:35.782
No need for me to answer you.

02:36.656 --> 02:38.021
Headed for Oomiya?

02:55.609 --> 02:58.510
Looks like there's no
need to ask you, either!

03:10.657 --> 03:12.852
Take that!

03:35.015 --> 03:39.281
Would that be the Satsuma
Jigen Ryu Dragonfly Stance?

03:50.997 --> 03:52.589
Is that you, Minekichi?

03:52.932 --> 03:54.797
That was pretty quick!

03:59.806 --> 04:02.036
I'm coming now, hang on!

04:15.121 --> 04:16.486
Is that Tohkichi downstairs?

04:18.158 --> 04:21.252
I bet he and Minekichi are
just fooling around again!

04:21.561 --> 04:22.960
Hey, don't tear the place down!

04:26.933 --> 04:29.527
Ryoma...

05:17.383 --> 05:17.974
What the...

05:37.537 --> 05:40.438
I-Impossible...

05:42.142 --> 05:44.007
You stepped in without dodging...

05:44.144 --> 05:47.910
Not only that, but your kick
was faster than my strike...

05:48.648 --> 05:53.642
One of my ancestors dodged the
sword of Musashi Miyamoto, I'm told.

06:26.319 --> 06:27.217
Ryoma!

06:36.262 --> 06:38.696
Ryoma, just don't die!

06:45.672 --> 06:49.005
Please, just this once,
you've got to draw your sword!

07:06.659 --> 07:07.921
Minekichi!

07:10.296 --> 07:12.958
Izumi...

07:13.333 --> 07:18.100
When I got back from buying the
shamo...

07:29.983 --> 07:30.915
Ryoma!

07:32.252 --> 07:34.516
You've got to hang on, Ryoma!

07:35.521 --> 07:36.647
Ryoma!

07:42.061 --> 07:43.551
Nakaoka!

07:46.766 --> 07:47.596
Ryoma!

07:51.471 --> 07:53.063
Izumi...

07:54.841 --> 07:56.069
Ryoma...

07:58.344 --> 08:06.513
Looks like I won't be
able to keep my promise...

08:09.822 --> 08:13.724
Can you forgive me?

08:16.029 --> 08:21.695
Still, the fact that I got to meet you...

08:22.735 --> 08:28.298
...that alone made me happy.

08:30.510 --> 08:31.534
Ryoma!

09:06.980 --> 09:08.242
Why...

09:08.748 --> 09:13.208
Why didn't you draw your sword?

09:16.189 --> 09:17.850
Until the very end...

09:19.092 --> 09:20.821
Until the very end...

09:22.095 --> 09:24.063
You were just...

09:27.233 --> 09:29.326
...too gentle for your own good!

09:31.904 --> 09:33.235
Izumi...

09:35.141 --> 09:40.238
Do you think it was the
Shinsengumi after all?

09:40.813 --> 09:43.407
Do you remember what
I told you that day?

09:43.883 --> 09:47.876
"In the future, if I ever
find you standing in my way..."

09:48.287 --> 09:51.484
"...then I'll kill you myself!"

09:53.026 --> 09:54.550
I hope you remember that.

09:56.195 --> 09:58.026
Hijikata!

10:03.870 --> 10:04.962
Izumi...

10:06.339 --> 10:08.864
Get yourself to the Tosa residence.

10:12.111 --> 10:14.341
Izumi, where are you going?

10:15.715 --> 10:17.080
Izumi!

10:18.418 --> 10:18.975
Don't tell me...

10:21.587 --> 10:22.451
Izumi!

11:13.773 --> 11:15.172
He can kick butt!

11:15.808 --> 11:17.639
That Sakamoto fellow, I mean.

11:18.578 --> 11:20.375
Just watch him, now.

11:21.013 --> 11:22.378
Match point!

11:22.648 --> 11:23.876
Stop!

11:24.617 --> 11:26.312
Cha, cha, cha!

11:26.752 --> 11:28.845
What do you know, I won!

11:31.757 --> 11:34.453
Hey, Sakamoto, you're a great
swordsman.

11:34.627 --> 11:37.391
Cha, cha, cha! You're embarrassing me!

11:37.864 --> 11:39.991
But you weren't going for the kill.

11:40.233 --> 11:43.100
I know that wasn't anywhere
near your best stuff...

11:43.636 --> 11:46.196
Oh, you don't think so?

11:46.506 --> 11:49.771
I'd like to make you go for the kill...

12:34.320 --> 12:35.252
What the...

12:50.303 --> 12:51.463
The sky...

12:51.604 --> 12:53.902
It's really high, huh, Izumi?

13:10.723 --> 13:13.317
I didn't think it would even budge, but...

13:13.759 --> 13:15.784
It might not have been
removed by a human...

13:15.962 --> 13:17.361
Izumi!

13:17.897 --> 13:20.263
You were able to remove it
because you're Ryoma Sakamoto...

13:20.466 --> 13:22.195
No question about it.

13:24.470 --> 13:25.334
Here!

13:35.114 --> 13:37.776
No human could pull
off that trick, either!

13:38.317 --> 13:43.254
Now no one but Ryoma Sakamoto can
ever withdraw this spear again.

14:05.144 --> 14:06.042
Back off!

14:06.178 --> 14:07.440
Get out of here!

14:07.580 --> 14:09.571
If you die now it will be for nothing!

14:09.882 --> 14:13.545
Use those lives of
yours for the new Japan!

14:14.754 --> 14:18.190
Izumi, it's all thanks to you!

14:19.859 --> 14:22.760
I wonder what people will
say about me when I'm gone?

14:22.895 --> 14:25.455
Ryoma worked so hard
for the country that...

14:25.965 --> 14:29.059
...he seemed like a
dragon riding a cloud...

14:29.669 --> 14:32.331
You think they'll say
something like that?

14:33.005 --> 14:35.803
True, I did get up on a cloud...

14:36.175 --> 14:39.269
...a nimbus cloud by the
name of Izumi Mutsu, that is.

14:40.046 --> 14:42.674
Because you stayed so
faithfully by my side...

14:42.782 --> 14:44.477
...I was able to do what I needed to do...

14:44.583 --> 14:47.211
...without having to
worry about getting killed.

14:47.553 --> 14:51.853
All I wanted was to go out and see
the world with you, Ryoma, that's all.

14:53.993 --> 14:55.722
You think we're the only ones?

14:55.861 --> 14:57.556
The only lunkheads who tried to...

14:57.697 --> 15:00.495
...change our whole world so
we could realize our dreams?

15:00.766 --> 15:02.097
Could be.

15:17.149 --> 15:20.346
<i>Shinsengumi Headquarters</i>

15:25.458 --> 15:26.356
Halt!

15:39.271 --> 15:40.829
Halt or we'll kill you!

15:59.358 --> 16:01.121
Who the hell are you?

16:01.594 --> 16:04.825
Are you aware that you've broken
into the Shinsengumi headquarters?

16:27.219 --> 16:28.447
What's going on?

16:28.587 --> 16:29.986
What's this commotion about?

16:33.159 --> 16:34.353
Who the hell is he?

16:35.327 --> 16:38.956
We don't know, he just
barged in all of a sudden.

16:39.231 --> 16:40.357
Is he with the Anti-Shogunate groups?

16:40.466 --> 16:41.728
Who gives a damn?

16:41.901 --> 16:43.163
Get rid of him right now!

16:44.770 --> 16:46.101
Out of my way.

16:47.373 --> 16:52.072
If you want to live, you
better not touch me right now!

17:07.426 --> 17:09.326
You tell Hijikata for me...

17:09.962 --> 17:12.590
...that Izumi Mutsu has arrived.

17:31.650 --> 17:36.053
You've broken into the
Shinsengumi Headquarters alone...

17:37.323 --> 17:42.283
Moreover, you're striding
through our property as if...

17:42.461 --> 17:45.396
...no one was here to challenge you...

17:46.131 --> 17:47.962
Deputy Commander!

17:49.502 --> 17:51.231
Izumi Mutsu...

17:51.804 --> 17:54.864
So we meet for the first time
since the Teradaya Incident!

17:57.343 --> 17:59.470
Hijikata!

18:00.546 --> 18:02.446
I warned you before...

18:02.715 --> 18:06.446
If I ever catch you laying
a hand on a friend of mine...

18:07.853 --> 18:11.220
...then I'll smash your Shinsengumi
to pieces with my own two hands!

18:19.598 --> 18:21.031
Yes, I remember.

18:21.667 --> 18:24.033
I've come here to keep that promise!

18:27.239 --> 18:28.797
What are you talking about?

18:32.912 --> 18:34.038
Don't tell me...

18:34.179 --> 18:36.773
Surely you're not saying that
Sakamoto's been assassinated?

18:36.949 --> 18:38.678
Drop the clueless act!

18:51.196 --> 18:53.357
So it is true, after all...

18:53.532 --> 18:56.933
...but the Shinsengumi
had nothing to do with it.

19:25.331 --> 19:31.497
The Tobaku group calls me
the Cold-blooded Demon Killer...

19:32.438 --> 19:36.966
And what they say is
true. But, I'm no liar.

19:37.443 --> 19:40.207
It wasn't the Shinsengumi.

19:49.054 --> 19:53.081
I have parted ways with the
Shinsengumi.

19:53.325 --> 19:57.489
I have come here today to warn you...

19:58.364 --> 19:59.991
Warn me?

20:01.567 --> 20:05.731
The Shinsengumi will
be coming after you!

20:10.542 --> 20:12.066
Sorry to bother you.

20:15.648 --> 20:16.706
Hijikata!

20:18.017 --> 20:20.713
I'm sure you know a
man by the name of Ito...

20:20.853 --> 20:21.842
Yes.

20:22.254 --> 20:23.983
He's a traitor.

20:24.523 --> 20:28.459
As soon as he saw that a new era
was upon us, he abandoned our group.

20:28.627 --> 20:31.994
Now he's the leader of a group trying
to ally itself with the Tobaku faction.

20:34.433 --> 20:37.027
The Shinsengumi will purge him.

20:37.302 --> 20:39.099
Even a Military Advisor must honor
the...

20:39.238 --> 20:41.866
...Shinsengumi code that
prohibits any member from leaving...

20:42.107 --> 20:45.440
It must be upheld at any cost!

20:46.979 --> 20:48.003
Don't touch him.

20:48.614 --> 20:49.672
What?

20:50.582 --> 20:52.049
I said don't touch him!

20:54.520 --> 20:57.956
That man is mine to kill.

21:02.327 --> 21:05.353
If anyone's going to avenge
Ryoma Sakamoto's death...

21:05.531 --> 21:06.589
...it will be me!

21:16.875 --> 21:20.777
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:31.423 --> 21:43.460
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at</i>
<i>them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:43.736 --> 21:53.475
<i>My loneliness and the vast night</i>
<i>sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:53.612 --> 22:02.611
<i>I just don't know what this</i>
<i>dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:02.755 --> 22:13.427
<i>Even if it's just "hello"</i>
<i>I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:14.466 --> 22:20.598
<i>The person I am today</i>
<i>is about to disappear...</i>

22:20.973 --> 22:23.965
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:24.843 --> 22:31.112
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:31.416 --> 22:36.911
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:52.237 --> 22:55.206
Ryoma, if only I'd been
there to protect you!

22:55.808 --> 22:58.641
If anyone's going to avenge Ryoma
Sakamoto's death, it will be me!

23:00.012 --> 23:01.912
Next episode of Age of Chaos...

23:02.147 --> 23:03.637
Farewell, My Friend.

23:03.782 --> 23:06.250
Pay close attention, and wait!
